</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Such was Thy grace that for our sake</l><l>Thou didst from heaven come down,</l><l>With us of flesh and blood partake,</l><l>In all our misery one.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Our sins, our guilt, in love Divine</l><l>Confessed and borne by Thee;</l><l>The gall, the curse, the wrath were Thine,</l><l>To set Thy members free.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Ascended now, in glory bright,</l><l>Head of the Church Thou art;</l><l>Nor life nor death, nor depth nor height,</l><l>Thy saints and Thee can part.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Oh teach us, Lord, to know and own</l><l>This wondrous mystery,</l><l>That Thou in heaven with us art one,</l><l>And we are one with Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Soon, soon shall come that glorious day</l><l>When, seated on Thy throne,</l><l>Thou shalt to wondering worlds display</l><l>That Thou with us art one.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
